### Franquix API - IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
### Run the requests top to bottom; ids are captured into variables (IntelliJ syntax).

@host = http://localhost:8080
@api = {{host}}/api/v1/franchises

### 1. Create a franchise
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Coffee" }

> {% client.global.set("franchiseId", response.body.id); %}

### 4. Add branch "Centro"
POST {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Centro" }

> {% client.global.set("centroId", response.body.id); %}

### 4. Add branch "Norte"
POST {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Norte" }

> {% client.global.set("norteId", response.body.id); %}

### 6. Add product to Centro
POST {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches/{{centroId}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Coffee", "stock": 120 }

> {% client.global.set("coffeeId", response.body.id); %}

### 6. Add another product to Centro
POST {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches/{{centroId}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Tea", "stock": 40 }

### 6. Add product to Norte
POST {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches/{{norteId}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bagel", "stock": 85 }

### 10. Top-stock product per branch
GET {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches/top-stock-products

### 7. Update stock
PATCH {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches/{{centroId}}/products/{{coffeeId}}/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 15 }

### 8. Rename product
PATCH {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches/{{centroId}}/products/{{coffeeId}}/name
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Espresso" }

### 5. Rename branch
PATCH {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches/{{centroId}}/name
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Downtown" }

### 3. Rename franchise
PATCH {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/name
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Coffee Global" }

### 2. Whole tree
GET {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}

### 9. Delete product
DELETE {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches/{{centroId}}/products/{{coffeeId}}

### Errors: 409 duplicate franchise
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Coffee Global" }

### Errors: 400 validation
POST {{api}}/{{franchiseId}}/branches/{{norteId}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": " ", "stock": -1 }

### Errors: 400 malformed id
GET {{api}}/not-an-id

### Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
